; Machine-specific PSNG hook - overrides psng/macros/_psng_hook.ngc
; (macros/ is ahead of psng/macros on SUBROUTINE_PATH).
; Called at the start of every PSNG macro with #1 = macro ID:
; 1 manual_change 2 tool_diameter 3 probe_table 4 probe_tool_setter
; 5 probe_workpiece 6 xminus 7 xplus 8 yminus 9 yplus

o<_psng_hook> sub
#<hooked_macro> = #1
; Every probing cycle wakes the GP-800 (even tool setter cycles - see CLAUDE.md)
o<probe_wake> call
o<_psng_hook> endsub
M2
